                {
                  "text": "65. Which of the following requirements were difficult to comply with for accreditation?",
                  "language": "FIL"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Aring mga requirements ang nadipisilan na icomply para sa akreditasyon? These are the requirements for YAKAP/Konsulta accreditation outlined by DOH. Ini an mga requirements para sa YAKAP/Konsulta accreditation kan DOH. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ALL THAT APPLY. Basahon an mga opsyon ki makusog. Pilion an dapat",
                  "language": "BCL"
                },
                {
                  "text": "65. Which of the following requirements were difficult to comply with for accreditation?",
                  "language": "BIS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Asa samga mosunod nga mga requirements ang lisud I comply para sa accreditation? These are the requirements for YAKAP/Konsulta accreditation outlined by DOH. READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ALL THAT APPLY. Mao kini ang mga requirements para sa YAKAP/Konsulta accreditation sa DOH BASAHA UG KUSOG ANG MGA TUBAG. PILIA ANG TANAN NGA MO APPLY",
                  "language": "CEB"
                },
                {
                  "text": "65. Which of the following requirements were difficult to comply with for accreditation?",
